d." (at 12 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "21181eff-6f5c-41ae-ad33-fe098bec6484")) (text "No fabricated ASIC, FPGA, radio or prosthetic driver is implied. GPIO parallel bus requires a specified module protocol." (at 12 264 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "6310720d-1c64-4194-8455-3e1747d8e229")) (text "External host/prosthetic/radio compute connection uses isolated USB only. J200/J61 are not patient-mode external ports." (at 12 276 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "9bf2cd7c-d539-403b-9ae0-9c7e2d6b4cae")) (text "UART/SPI are wired shared research ports: populate only one conflicting endpoint. Motors/actuators need independent safety." (at 12 288 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "65fb5046-6298-409d-8a52-e0834d84122b")) (text "16 channels are implemented. Higher channel counts require bandwidth, power, FPGA and connector design; no 3072-channel claim." (at 12 300 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "460decfc-f344-4fbc-85b1-564d18180476")) (text "MODULE_EN/RESET default low. Firmware may release only after local rails, module PGOOD and fault checks succeed." (at 12 312 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "8724f9df-bec3-45bc-885a-1eaf2af6941b")))